# ---- personal data -------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Never commit rosters, contact exports, or
# screenshots holding player or parent details — names, emails, phone numbers.
# Keep them in an ignored folder and import them through the admin UI or a
# secret, never through git.
/montco/
*roster-export*
*contact-export*

# ---- credentials ---------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase service-account keys grant full admin and bypass every security
# rule. One committed to a public repo compromises the whole project.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
